I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/notifier@0.1.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` needs filesystem authority that isn't granted, and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` needs `aap:caps/http-client`, which isn't granted either. Adding either would widen the node's authority beyond its declared clause, so they need to be granted through the graph's `with` clause first.

